A. Face Tracking and ROI Segmentation
Considering the inherent head movements that occur during driving, precise face detection and tracking are crucial in our study. To achieve this, we directly obtained the video data collected from the DMS and utilized the LAB algorithm developed by SenseTime [29] employed in the DMS of our collaborative company. This algorithm provided us with the coordinates of 106 facial landmarks in each frame of the video. By leveraging this algorithm, we were able to accurately locate and track the 106 facial landmarks, which provided valuable information for subsequent analysis.

