A. Experimental Setup
The experimental setup, depicted in Fig. 4, included the following components: a test vehicle (Model: NIO ET7), a camera lens, a laptop, and a pulse oximeter. The camera utilized a monochromatic CMOS image sensor (Model: Onsemi AR0144AT) equipped with a 940-nm narrowband filter and two 940-nm wavelength light-emitting diodes (LEDs). It was integrated into the vehicle’s DMS, positioned just below the

