Utilizing the face recognition algorithm within the DMS, the camera captured facial images of the driver at a frame rate of 30 frames/s. The recorded images had a resolution of 1280 × 800 pixels. The camera incorporated auto-exposure control to optimize facial illumination, ensuring precise capture of facial movements.
